  public void RefreshView(){var s=game.State;if(initialized&&language==s.Settings.language&&revision==game.PresentationRevision){var rect=(RectTransform)transform;float top=viewport.InverseTransformPoint(rect.TransformPoint(new Vector3(0,rect.rect.yMax,0))).y,bottom=viewport.InverseTransformPoint(rect.TransformPoint(new Vector3(0,rect.rect.yMin,0))).y;if(top<viewport.rect.yMin||bottom>viewport.rect.yMax)return;}initialized=true;bool training=kind=="training",de=s.Settings.language=="de";int current=training?Game.TrainingLevel(s,id):s.Research[index];bool quote=Time.unscaledTime>=nextQuote||level!=current||quality!=s.Quality||efficiency!=s.Efficiency||integration!=s.Workshop.integration||language!=s.Settings.language||revision!=game.PresentationRevision;
   if(quote){nextQuote=Time.unscaledTime+1;level=current;quality=s.Quality;efficiency=s.Efficiency;integration=s.Workshop.integration;language=s.Settings.language;revision=game.PresentationRevision;Card.Title.text=(training?Name(id):SettingsRules.Text(language,"research:"+id))+" · Lv.\u00a0"+level;cost=training?Game.TrainingCost(s,id):ScientificNumber.Zero;dataCost=training?Game.TrainingData(s,id):Game.ResearchCost(s,index);Credits.text=N(cost);Data.text=N(dataCost);CreditIcon.transform.parent.gameObject.SetActive(training);DataIcon.transform.parent.gameObject.SetActive(!training||!dataCost.IsZero);Details.GetComponentInChildren<Text>().text="i";double work=training?Game.TrainingWork(s,id):Game.ResearchWork(s,index),speed=training?(id=="quality"&&Game.IntroQuality(s)?1:Game.WorkSpeed(s)):(id=="dataGeneration"&&Game.IntroResearch(s)?1:Game.ResearchSpeed(s));Duration.text=LearningPresentation.Remaining(training?work/speed:Game.ResearchDuration(s,id),language,true);
